description:
Power-ups are not appearing in-game despite BAM-b82 adding textures.

**Root Cause Identified:**
The power-up velocity is being set in the PowerUp constructor BEFORE adding to the physics group. When the PowerUp is added to the powerUpGroup (which was created with physics.add.group({ allowGravity: false })), Phaser may reset the velocity to 0.

**Fix Required:**
In packages/client/src/systems/BlockSpawner.ts, modify the spawnPowerUp method to set velocity AFTER adding to the group:

  const powerUp = new PowerUp(this.scene, x, y, type);
  this.powerUpGroup.add(powerUp);
  // Set velocity AFTER adding to group
  powerUp.setVelocityY(BLOCK_FALL_SPEED * 0.7);

**Files to modify:**
1. packages/client/src/systems/BlockSpawner.ts - Add velocity setting after group.add()
2. packages/client/src/entities/PowerUp.ts - Remove velocity from constructor (optional cleanup)
